{"ts":"2026-08-28T14:42:31.427Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-5.6-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"143da6b99c6d50ff73f411da","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-5.6-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-xrjy8o"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-1136: npm 12 object-form npm pack receipts break registry package installs"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Track GitHub issue #1136: npm 12 changed `npm pack --json` from an array to an object keyed by package name. The package-source parser accepts only the older array shape and then misclassifies valid but unrecognized JSON as a line-oriented filename, producing a tar path ending in `}` and breaking every explicit npm extension install."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","github","npm","package-ecosystem","regression"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-28T14:42:31.427Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-28T14:42:31.427Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Parse npm 11 array and npm 12 object receipts through one typed SDK-owned contract; select the requested entry deterministically; never apply a filename fallback after JSON parsed successfully; add npm 11/12 unit, integration, packed-consumer, and negative malformed-shape coverage; preserve actionable structured CLI errors."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-ugqx"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/reporter","value":"GitHub issue #1136"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/environment","value":"npm 12.0.2, Node 26.5.0, Linux; explicit npm: package sources"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"Run `pm package install npm:pm-brief` under npm 12.0.2; observe the valid object-form pack receipt fall through to a tarball path named `}`."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"The package source accepts every documented npm pack JSON shape, selects the requested package deterministically, and fails closed with a shape-specific diagnostic when well-formed JSON is unsupported."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Object-form npm 12 receipts are ignored after successful JSON parsing; the last pretty-printed line `}` is treated as a filename and tar fails with ENOENT."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/affected_version","value":"2026.8.27-2026.8.28"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"package-install"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/regression","value":true},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/customer_impact","value":"All explicit registry extension installs are broken for users on current npm 12, including every published first-party package."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-495lkc","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-28T14:42:31.427Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-tnud","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-28T14:42:31.427Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-28T14:42:31.427Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate check: complete all-status searches for npm 12,npm pack,package install,tarball,and pack output shape found package-lifecycle ancestors and related closed incidents but no item owning the npm 12 object-form receipt plus fail-closed fallback defect. GitHub issue #1136 is theref